:: OC Patrick and Carter Playground [nobr]

/* Intro */
You are chilling out in the shaded area by some pull up bars when you suddenly hear a voice call <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Watch out!”</span> You turn just in time to see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> barreling towards you! <span style="color:LightCoral">Crash!</span> <span style="color:Yellow">You both are sent flying into the dirt as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> comes rushing over, only to trip on his shoelace and crash into the pile as well,</span> <span style="color:Pink">leaving you on the ground with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span>’s butt in your face and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> tangled around your legs.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 1,
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC Patrick",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Happy",
                Blush: 1,
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Whoops, haha.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> says as he stands up, quickly helping <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> and then you to your feet as well. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“My bad, shoelaces.”</span> <span style="color:Pink">He laughs, holding up his foot to show that his shoes are indeed untied. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> looks down to embarrassingly see his shoes are also untied.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“S- sorry about that, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$CarterNickname</span>!”</span> He apologizes as he quickly kneels down to tie his shoes. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span>, meanwhile, instead just kicks his shoes off before patting the dirt off of you. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We were playing, pretending to case down a villain and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> tripped and when I tried to catch him before he crashed I…”</span> He laughs nervously as you roll your eyes, either annoyed at their clumsiness or finding it endearing. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey! Did you want to play with us?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> suddenly snaps up happily, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We need someone to play the villain! You’ll be great!”</span> You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> what that is supposed to mean, but he just shrugs and asks again. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Come on, please! We’ll even let you win, maybe, if you’re strong enough!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">smiles widely as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> rubs the back of his head nervously, obviously hoping you’ll join as well.</span> <br>
<br>

<div id="Choice1">
	<<link "Join in<br>">>
	<<replace"#Choice1">>
        <span style="color:LightGreen">You smile and nod, agreeing to join in as the villain to their daring duo. Both boys smile at this, with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> jumping up and down excitedly!</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Perfect! Now we have someone to fight and hunt down!”</span> He laughs, before leaning in and saying, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“And maybe when we capture you, I can lock you in a special ‘padded’ cell.”</span> <span style="color:Pink">He winks slyly at you, making it clear what he means.</span> <br>
        <br>
        Despite this, you, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>, and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> spend the next few minutes playing around and pretending to do battle. <span style="color:Pink">Interestingly, you see the waistbands of both boys as they jump around and kick, with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span>’s padding standing out.</span> You wonder if <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> had noticed it yet, though chose not to bring it up <span style="color:LightGreen">and instead enjoy your playful adventures with both of them.</span> <br>
        <<socialChange "Patrick" 3 1>>
        <<socialChange "Carter" 3>>
        <<addMoodlet "Stress" 0>>
        <<needChange "Fun" 20>>
        <br>
        [[Continue|School Courtyard]] 
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Refuse<br>">>
	<<replace"#Choice1">>
        <span style="color:Yellow">Either annoyed at the boy’s antics, too tired to play right now, or simply just not wanting to, you refuse their offer.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> instantly frowns, offering up another <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Please!”</span> but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> nods in understanding. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It’s alright, he’s probably busy. Hey, how about instead of chasing a villain we case the area for clues? See if we can find evidence of any crime!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Patrick</span> perks up at this, and both boys run off happily to continue playing. Those two are actually pretty alike. <br>
        <<addMoodlet "Stress" 0>>
        <<needChange "Fun" 20>>
        <br>
        [[Continue|School Courtyard]] 
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>
